ximum size"</td><td>The picture is very large</td><td>Email the picture to yourself choosing a smaller size, then upload that</td></tr><tr><td>You cannot log in</td><td>Wrong password, or the WordPress user changed</td><td>Use <strong>WP Admin</strong> from <a href="https://hpanel.hostinger.com,">https://hpanel.hostinger.com,</a> which does not need the WordPress password</td></tr></tbody>
